  "description": "Dependency-free PDF reader and rasterizer for DocWright. Parses an arbitrary PDF — cross-reference tables and streams, the object graph, stream filters, content streams, colour spaces and embedded font programs — and renders pages to PNG or JPEG. Read and rasterize only: it does not write PDF (see DocWright.Renderers.Pdf) and does not import into the editable document model. Most users should install the DocWright package instead, which includes this one.",
